{"seq":2,"slug":"svg-animation","title":"SVG 动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/canvas-svg-advanced/svg-animation","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"svg-动画\">SVG 动画</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SVG 动画是 Web 平台上实现矢量图形动态效果的技术体系。它包含三种互补的动画方案：SMIL 声明式动画（SVG 原生）、CSS 动画（样式驱动）和 JavaScript 动画（程序化控制）。SVG 动画天然继承了矢量图形的无损缩放特性，在任何分辨率下都保持清晰，适合图标动画、数据可视化过渡和交互式信息图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SVG 动画] --&gt; B[SMIL 动画]&#10;    A --&gt; C[CSS 动画]&#10;    A --&gt; D[JavaScript 动画]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[animate 标签]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[animateTransform]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[animateMotion]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[transition]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[keyframes]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[CSS 自定义属性]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Web Animations API]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[requestAnimationFrame]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[GSAP/anime.js]\">graph TD\n    A[SVG 动画] --&gt; B[SMIL 动画]\n    A --&gt; C[CSS 动画]\n    A --&gt; D[JavaScript 动画]\n    B --&gt; B1[animate 标签]\n    B --&gt; B2[animateTransform]\n    B --&gt; B3[animateMotion]\n    C --&gt; C1[transition]\n    C --&gt; C2[keyframes]\n    C --&gt; C3[CSS 自定义属性]\n    D --&gt; D1[Web Animations API]\n    D --&gt; D2[requestAnimationFrame]\n    D --&gt; D3[GSAP/anime.js]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>SMIL</th>\n<th>CSS</th>\n<th>JavaScript</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明方式</td>\n<td>XML 标签</td>\n<td>样式规则</td>\n<td>代码逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径动画</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>需 offset-path</td>\n<td>手动计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换动画</td>\n<td>animateTransform</td>\n<td>transform</td>\n<td>完全控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互触发</td>\n<td>begin/end 属性</td>\n<td>:hover/:active</td>\n<td>addEventListener</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>GPU 加速</td>\n<td>GPU 加速</td>\n<td>取决于实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>Chrome/Firefox/Safari</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种方案的选择原则：简单的状态过渡用 CSS，路径动画和交互序列用 SMIL，复杂的程序化动画和精确时序控制用 JavaScript。</p>\n<h2 id=\"css-驱动的-svg-动画\">CSS 驱动的 SVG 动画</h2><p>CSS 动画是 SVG 动画中最简单且性能最好的方案，可以直接对 SVG 属性使用 <code>transition</code> 和 <code>@keyframes</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const svgWithCssAnimation = `&#10;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 400 200&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;style&gt;&#10;    .pulse-circle {&#10;      transform-origin: center;&#10;      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;&#10;    }&#10;    @keyframes pulse {&#10;      0%, 100% { r: 30; opacity: 1; }&#10;      50% { r: 45; opacity: 0.6; }&#10;    }&#10;    &#10;    .bar {&#10;      transition: height 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),&#10;                  y 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);&#10;    }&#10;    .bar:hover {&#10;      height: 120;&#10;      y: 30;&#10;    }&#10;    &#10;    .line-path {&#10;      stroke-dasharray: 1000;&#10;      stroke-dashoffset: 1000;&#10;      animation: draw-line 2s ease forwards;&#10;    }&#10;    @keyframes draw-line {&#10;      to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }&#10;    }&#10;  &lt;/style&gt;&#10;  &#10;  &lt;circle class=&quot;pulse-circle&quot; cx=&quot;50&quot; cy=&quot;100&quot; r=&quot;30&quot; fill=&quot;steelblue&quot;/&gt;&#10;  &lt;rect class=&quot;bar&quot; x=&quot;120&quot; y=&quot;50&quot; width=&quot;40&quot; height=&quot;100&quot; fill=&quot;coral&quot;/&gt;&#10;  &lt;path class=&quot;line-path&quot; d=&quot;M200,150 Q250,30 300,100 T400,80&quot; &#10;        fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;steelblue&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot;/&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> svgWithCssAnimation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;style></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    .pulse-circle {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      transform-origin: center;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @keyframes pulse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      0%, 100% { r: 30; opacity: 1; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      50% { r: 45; opacity: 0.6; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    .bar {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      transition: height 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                  y 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    .bar:hover {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      height: 120;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      y: 30;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    .line-path {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      stroke-dasharray: 1000;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      stroke-dashoffset: 1000;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      animation: draw-line 2s ease forwards;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @keyframes draw-line {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;/style></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;circle class=\"pulse-circle\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"steelblue\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;rect class=\"bar\" x=\"120\" y=\"50\" width=\"40\" height=\"100\" fill=\"coral\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;path class=\"line-path\" d=\"M200,150 Q250,30 300,100 T400,80\" </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"steelblue\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/svg></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>线条绘制动画（stroke-dasharray/stroke-dashoffset）是 SVG + CSS 最经典的动画效果：通过设置虚线间隔等于路径总长，然后动画减少偏移量，产生线条逐渐绘制的视觉效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const animatePathDrawing = (pathElement: SVGPathElement): void =&gt; {&#10;  const length = pathElement.getTotalLength();&#10;  pathElement.style.strokeDasharray = `${length}`;&#10;  pathElement.style.strokeDashoffset = `${length}`;&#10;&#10;  pathElement.animate([{ strokeDashoffset: length }, { strokeDashoffset: 0 }], {&#10;    duration: 2000,&#10;    easing: &#39;ease-in-out&#39;,&#10;    fill: &#39;forwards&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> animatePathDrawing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pathElement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SVGPathElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pathElement.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTotalLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pathElement.style.strokeDasharray </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">length</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pathElement.style.strokeDashoffset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">length</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pathElement.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([{ strokeDashoffset: length }, { strokeDashoffset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    easing: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ease-in-out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fill: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forwards'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"smil-路径动画\">SMIL 路径动画</h2><p>SMIL（Synchronized Multimedia Integration Language）是 SVG 原生的动画标准，对路径动画有独特的支持能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const smilMotionAnimation = `&#10;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 500 300&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;path id=&quot;motionPath&quot; &#10;        d=&quot;M50,250 C150,50 350,50 450,250&quot; &#10;        fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;#ccc&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1&quot; stroke-dasharray=&quot;5,5&quot;/&gt;&#10;  &#10;  &lt;circle r=&quot;8&quot; fill=&quot;steelblue&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;animateMotion dur=&quot;3s&quot; repeatCount=&quot;indefinite&quot; rotate=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;mpath href=&quot;#motionPath&quot;/&gt;&#10;    &lt;/animateMotion&gt;&#10;  &lt;/circle&gt;&#10;  &#10;  &lt;rect x=&quot;-15&quot; y=&quot;-10&quot; width=&quot;30&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; rx=&quot;5&quot; fill=&quot;coral&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;animateMotion dur=&quot;4s&quot; begin=&quot;1s&quot; repeatCount=&quot;indefinite&quot; rotate=&quot;auto&quot;&#10;                   path=&quot;M100,150 Q250,50 400,150 Q250,250 100,150&quot;/&gt;&#10;  &lt;/rect&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> smilMotionAnimation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;path id=\"motionPath\" </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        d=\"M50,250 C150,50 350,50 450,250\" </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;circle r=\"8\" fill=\"steelblue\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    &#x3C;animateMotion dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" rotate=\"auto\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      &#x3C;mpath href=\"#motionPath\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    &#x3C;/animateMotion></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;/circle></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;rect x=\"-15\" y=\"-10\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"coral\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    &#x3C;animateMotion dur=\"4s\" begin=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" rotate=\"auto\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                   path=\"M100,150 Q250,50 400,150 Q250,250 100,150\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;/rect></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/svg></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[animateMotion] --&gt; B[沿路径移动]&#10;    A --&gt; C[rotate=auto 自动朝向]&#10;    A --&gt; D[keyPoints 关键点]&#10;    E[animate] --&gt; F[属性值动画]&#10;    E --&gt; G[累加/替换模式]&#10;    H[animateTransform] --&gt; I[旋转]&#10;    H --&gt; J[缩放]&#10;    H --&gt; K[平移]\">graph LR\n    A[animateMotion] --&gt; B[沿路径移动]\n    A --&gt; C[rotate=auto 自动朝向]\n    A --&gt; D[keyPoints 关键点]\n    E[animate] --&gt; F[属性值动画]\n    E --&gt; G[累加/替换模式]\n    H[animateTransform] --&gt; I[旋转]\n    H --&gt; J[缩放]\n    H --&gt; K[平移]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SMIL 元素</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&lt;animate&gt;</code></td>\n<td>属性值动画</td>\n<td>attributeName, from, to, dur</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;animateTransform&gt;</code></td>\n<td>变换动画</td>\n<td>type(rotate/scale/translate)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;animateMotion&gt;</code></td>\n<td>路径动画</td>\n<td>path, rotate, keyPoints</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;set&gt;</code></td>\n<td>离散值设置</td>\n<td>to, begin</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"web-animations-api\">Web Animations API</h2><p>Web Animations API（WAAPI）提供了 JavaScript 级别的动画控制，结合了 CSS 动画的性能和 JavaScript 的灵活性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SVGAnimationConfig {&#10;  element: SVGElement;&#10;  keyframes: Keyframe[];&#10;  options: KeyframeAnimationOptions;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createSequen