r>\n<td>交互反馈</td>\n<td>hover/click 响应</td>\n<td>100-300ms</td>\n<td>ease</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强调动画</td>\n<td>高亮关键数据</td>\n<td>200-500ms</td>\n<td>ease-out</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加载指示</td>\n<td>等待数据</td>\n<td>循环</td>\n<td>linear</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>动画设计的核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有意义</strong>：每个动画都应传达信息（数据从哪来、变化了多少）</li>\n<li><strong>不干扰</strong>：动画不能延缓用户获取信息的速度</li>\n<li><strong>可预测</strong>：相同的交互应产生相同的动画效果</li>\n<li><strong>可中断</strong>：用户操作应能打断进行中的动画</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const animateDataUpdate = (group: SVGGElement, oldData: number[], newData: number[]): void =&gt; {&#10;  const bars = group.querySelectorAll&lt;SVGRectElement&gt;(&#39;rect&#39;);&#10;&#10;  bars.forEach((bar, i) =&gt; {&#10;    const animations = bar.getAnimations();&#10;    animations.forEach((a) =&gt; a.cancel());&#10;&#10;    const oldHeight = oldData[i];&#10;    const newHeight = newData[i];&#10;&#10;    bar.animate([{ height: `${oldHeight}px` }, { height: `${newHeight}px` }], {&#10;      duration: 600,&#10;      easing: &#39;ease-in-out&#39;,&#10;      fill: &#39;forwards&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> animateDataUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">group</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SVGGElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">oldData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">